    {
      "bbox": [
        121.06053586601308,
        440.8977061237374,
        829.4013636437909,
        10.751926452020257
      ],
      "text": "In 2000, 30% of the Company\u2019s revenues were generated in Poland and Hungary, as compared to 27% in 1999 and 73% in 1998. The 2000",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
