        829.6805689542483,
        10.794854797979838
      ],
      "text": "Hungarian Forint and in Poland, the majority of revenues are denominated in Polish Zloty. However the majority of these foreign curre n c y",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
