        480.34422285353537,
        829.3899379084968,
        10.794854797979838
      ],
      "text": "denominated contracts are linked either to inflation or the retail price index. While it remains the case that a significant portion of the Company\u2019s",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
